      "description": "Center for Career & Vocation - Bluffton University skip to main content Bluffton University Menu Close Menu Admission & aid Admission & Aid Apply Visit Financial Aid Accepted Students Adult and Graduate Students Transfer Students International Students Undergraduate academics Academics Programs of Study Student Success Center for Career and Vocation Cross-Cultural Experiences Bluffton Blueprint Academic Honors Academic Resources Adult & graduate academics Master of Business Administration Master of Arts in Education Master of Social Work Master of Nutrition and Dietetics Student life Student Life Student Engagement Intramurals Residence Life Spiritual Life Multicultural Affairs Health & Wellness Student Handbook About About Bluffton Facts & Figures Visit & Directions Campus Facilities News & Events We Are Beavers All Directory Employment Athletics Blufftonbeavers.com Athletics Hall of Fame Athletic Enews Signup We Remember 3/2/2007 Request info Visit Apply Give Search Search Close Search Info For: Current students Parents & families Faculty & staff Alumni & friends my.Bluffton Moodle News & Events Home Academic Life Center for Career & Vocation Academic Life Open Secondary Nav Center for Career & Vocation The Center for Career & Vocation (CCV) at Bluffton University empowers students and\n                        alumni to explore meaningful career paths and build professional success. We offer personalized guidance in career exploration, career and major assessments,\n                        major advising, career advising, job and internship search strategies, and graduate\n                        school planning. Our team provides expert resume and cover letter review, interview\n                        preparation, career application support, and access to professional networking resources\n                        including the College Central Network (CCN) job board and LinkedIn support. CCV services\n                        are available throughout your time at Bluffton and beyond, helping you connect your\n                        strengths, interests and calling with real opportunities. Resources Professional Resume Template Academic Resume Template Cover Letter Template Professional Email Guide Make an appointment today Build your career portfolio with help from the CCV. Get connected College Central Network Jobs and internships available. Opportunities Bluffton University Contact us Directions Campus map Employment Media LinkedIn Facebook Instagram YouTube All Rights reserved © 2026| 1 University Drive, Bluffton, Ohio 45817 419-358-3000 Accreditation information Consumer information Privacy policy Top ©"
